@startuml
title Template creation and use

skinparam backgroundColor #18191b
skinparam defaultFontColor #e6e7e9
skinparam sequenceArrowColor #89919e
skinparam sequenceLifeLineBorderColor #4b5059
skinparam sequenceParticipantBackgroundColor #232529
skinparam sequenceParticipantBorderColor #4b5059

actor Creator
participant "Template panel" as Panel
participant EditorViewModel as VM
participant TemplateBuilder as Builder
participant TemplateStore as Store
participant TemplateInstantiator as Instantiator
participant TimelineEditor as Editor

== Create a reusable template ==
Creator -> Panel: Save current edit as template
Panel -> VM: CreateTemplate(name, category)
VM -> Builder: FromTimeline(timeline, project media)
Builder --> VM: VideoTemplate with typed slots
VM -> Store: Save(template)
Store --> VM: persisted template
VM --> Panel: refresh My templates

== Use a template ==
Creator -> Panel: Search, filter, select
Panel --> Creator: preview structure, duration, slots
Creator -> Panel: Use template
Panel -> VM: UseTemplate(template)
VM -> Instantiator: ValidateAssignments(template, media)
alt missing or incompatible media
  Instantiator --> VM: actionable slot errors
  VM --> Panel: show replacement requirements
else assignments valid
  VM -> Instantiator: Instantiate(template, assignments)
  Instantiator --> VM: fresh timeline and clip IDs
  VM -> Editor: replace empty timeline
  VM --> Panel: open replacement workflow
end
@enduml
